@startuml
title E01 - Node health, battery and coverage
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
control "Node wake / heartbeat timer" as NodeTimer
control "N03\nNode power" as N03
control "N02\nNode radio" as N02
control "H04\nHub coverage" as H04
control "B08\nOperations/data" as B08
boundary "A02\nApp home" as A02
NodeTimer -> N03: Wake and sample calibrated battery voltage/status
N03 -> N03: Classify UNKNOWN/OK/LOW/CRITICAL without invented percentage
N03 -> N02: Create heartbeat with battery band and sensor status
N02 -> H04: Deliver contact/heartbeat through authorized hub ingest
H04 -> H04: Refresh source lease; retain explicit sensor fault
H04 -> B08: Publish health/coverage reason through hub cloud path
B08 -> A02: Return node reachability, battery and coverage separately
note over N03,A02: Software thresholds do not replace protected cells, charger qualification or measured runtime.
note over NodeTimer,A02: Outcome - Battery, contact and sensor faults are visible as separate facts and required-source expiry becomes coverage unknown.
@enduml
